graph TD
    subgraph "IA Meridian (Data Flows)"
        WAL[Workpaper Authoring & Lifecycle<br>Structured Content, Versions, States]
        IAA[Intelligent Assistance<br>AI Suggestions, Evidence Assembly]
        GAL[Audit Trail & Lineage<br>Events, Hashes, Lineage Records]
        UAO[Analytics & Insights<br>Metrics, KPIs from Projections]
        INT["Integration Layer<br>APIs, Events, Exports (PDF/Word w/ Hashes)"]
    end

    subgraph "External Systems"
        DL["Data Lake<br>Authoritative Evidence, Source Data"]
        AB["AuditBoard/APEX<br>Audit Management, Archival, Submissions"]
        GRC["GRC Platforms<br>Issue Management, Findings"]
        HCM["HCM Systems<br>User Data, Roles"]
        SIMPL["SIMPL<br>Audit Tools, Issues"]
        GSAI["GS-AI Platform<br>Governed Models"]
    end

    DL -->|"Pull Evidence/Data (APIs)"| IAA
    IAA -->|"Assembled Data (Masked)"| WAL
    WAL -->|Structured Updates| GAL
    WAL -->|Finalized Artifacts/Data| INT
    INT -->|"Export PDFs w/ Hashes (Immutable)"| AB
    INT -->|"Push Findings/Status (Events/APIs)"| GRC
    INT -->|Data Exchange| SIMPL
    HCM -->|Sync Users/Roles| INT
    WAL -->|Telemetry/Events| UAO
    GAL -->|Event Projections| UAO
    IAA -->|"Governed Calls (Prompts/Outputs Logged)"| GSAI
    GSAI -->|Suggestions| IAA
    GAL -->|"Lineage Links (Sources to Exports)"| INT
    INT -->|"Integrity Verification (Hashes)"| AB

